  "body": "...Or is it just not implemented in any browser yet?\r\n\r\nRequest and Response both implement Body. But so far i have only seen Response having a readable body stream.\r\n\r\nThe only way to get the content from a Request is throught arrayBuffer, text, FormData, json or Blob but i wan't the stream so i can use pipes",
